@startuml

title Offer phase

participant Client1
participant Server
participant Client2

loop each player chooses one available offer tile
Server-->Client1: GameViewUpdate(active player and offers)
Client1->Server: ChooseOfferRequest(offerTileIndex)

alt valid choice by the active player
Server->Server: assign offer and advance turn
opt this was the final offer choice
Server->Server: enter ROUND_ACTIONS
end
Server-->Client1: GameViewUpdate(updated snapshot and status)
Server-->Client2: GameViewUpdate(updated snapshot and status)
Server-->Client1: GameOperationResult(Offer tile chosen, same snapshot)
else invalid offer, wrong phase, or wrong player
Server-->Client1: GameOperationResult(failure, current snapshot)
end
end

note over Client1, Client2
Only subscribers receive asynchronous GameViewUpdate messages.
The acting client also receives the direct operation result.
end note

@enduml
